          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellCenter"><text:p text:style-name="Normal">신청비용</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p text:style-name="Center">* 진료비상세내역서에 기재된 <text:span text:style-name="Bold">진찰료 및 확진검사비</text:span>에 한함</text:p></table:table-cell>
